<div class="pt-20 bg-[#f4e6e2] text-[#2f1f1d]">
  <section class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1200px] px-6 py-20 sm:px-10">
    <div class="rounded-[28px] border border-[#e5d2cd] bg-white p-8 shadow-sm sm:p-12">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-[#8f1f2a]">Terms</p>
      <h1 class="mt-4 font-serif text-4xl font-bold sm:text-5xl">Terms of Service</h1>
      <div class="mt-4 h-1 w-20 rounded-full bg-[#8f1f2a]"></div>

      <div class="mt-10 space-y-8 text-[#5d4543]">
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-semibold text-[#2f1f1d]">1. Reservation policy</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
            Reservations are subject to availability and confirmation. Guests are expected to arrive on time, and we reserve the right to release tables after a short grace period.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-semibold text-[#2f1f1d]">2. Food and beverage service</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
            All menu items and special requests are prepared in good faith. We do our best to accommodate dietary preferences and allergies, but final preparation depends on ingredient availability and kitchen operations.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-semibold text-[#2f1f1d]">3. Payment and cancellation</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
            Some reservations may require a deposit or prepayment depending on the booking type. Late cancellations or no-shows may be charged according to policy.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-semibold text-[#2f1f1d]">4. Acceptance of terms</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
            By making a reservation or using our services, you acknowledge that you have read and agreed to these terms.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
        <%= link_to "Reserve a Table", reservations_path,
              class: "inline-block rounded-sm bg-[#8f1f2a] px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-white transition hover:bg-[#7a1a23]" %>
        <%= link_to "Privacy Policy", privacy_policy_path,
              class: "inline-block rounded-sm border border-[#8f1f2a] px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[#8f1f2a] transition hover:bg-[#8f1f2a] hover:text-white" %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
